OL,3,GNEWSACity mosque reopens after six-year
OL,4,Aclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincolnshire's first mosque, which has
OL,7,Fbeen shut for six years, has reopened
OL,8,Ffollowing a refurbishment.
OL,10,FLincoln City Mosque on Orchard Street
OL,11,Fwas founded in 1981 but closed during
OL,12,Fthe Covid-19 pandemic because it needed
OL,13,F"significant" restoration work.
OL,15,FDr Tanweer Ahmed, chair of the Islamic
OL,16,Fassociation of Lincoln, said the mosque
OL,17,Fhad undergone a #350,000 refurbishment
OL,18,Fand said "it looks very beautiful now".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
